---
import Store from '../layouts/Store.astro';
---
<Store title="Your selection"><section class="wrap selection"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ODISHA, CHOSEN BY YOU</p><h1>Your <em>selection.</em></h1><p class="lead">Tell us what you’d like. There’s nothing to pay today.</p><p class="notice">This is a pre-order interest request, not a purchase or a stock reservation. We’ll contact you when the product is ready, with its final price and details. You can decide whether to buy then.</p><div id="selection-items"></div><p id="selection-status" role="status"></p><section class="selection-summary" id="request-panel"><h2 id="selection-count">Your selection</h2><p id="service-status" role="status">Checking whether interest requests are open…</p><form id="interest-form" class="stack-form"><label for="customer-name">Your name</label><input id="customer-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="100" required/><label for="customer-email">Email address</label><input id="customer-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required/><label class="check-label"><input name="contact_consent" type="checkbox" required/><span>I agree that Odisha Store may contact me by email about this preorder interest. No payment or stock reservation is made.</span></label><p class="small-print">We use your name, email and selection to manage this request. <a href="/privacy/">How we handle your information</a>.</p><button class="button" id="submit-interest" disabled>Send pre-order interest</button></form><p id="request-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><a class="text-link" href="/catalog/">Continue exploring →</a></section><section id="receipt" class="receipt" tabindex="-1" hidden><p class="eyebrow">THANK YOU</p><h2>Your interest is registered.</h2><p id="receipt-reference"></p><p>No payment has been taken and no stock is reserved. We’ll contact you by email when the product is ready, with final details and pricing. Please save this reference for any questions about your request.</p><a class="button" href="/catalog/">Back to the collection</a></section><noscript><p>JavaScript is needed to load your saved selection and submit interest. No request has been sent.</p></noscript></section></Store>
<script>import '../scripts/bag.js';</script>
